  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n{k⁴} + (1)/({{k⁴)}} = 47\n\n**Concept used:**\n\nIf {a} + (1)/({{a)}} = b\n\nThe,\n\n {a³} + (1)/({{a³)}} = b³-3b\n\n ({a} + (1)/({{a)}})² = a² + (1)/(a²)+2\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n{k⁴} + (1)/({{k⁴)}} = 47\n\n⇒ {k⁴} + (1)/({{k⁴)}} +2= 47+2\n\n⇒ ({k²} + (1)/({{k²)}})²= 49\n\n⇒ {k²} + (1)/({{k²)}}= 7\n\n⇒ {k²} + (1)/({{k²)}}+2= 7+2\n\n⇒ ({k} + (1)/({{k)}})²= 9\n\n⇒ {k} + (1)/({{k)}}= 3\n\nNow,\n\n{k³} + (1)/({{k³)}} = 3³ - 3 × 3\n\n⇒ {k³} + (1)/({{k³)}} = 27 - 9\n\n⇒ {k³} + (1)/({{k³)}} = 18\n\n**∴ The required answer is 18.**",
